# aceptriana/alma-trader at its full 128k context, sized to stay entirely on
# one 8 GiB card. See README.md for the measurements behind both numbers.
#
# The base model sets num_ctx 8192 in its own Modelfile, so raising it here is
# an override rather than a default. Its sampling parameters (temperature 0.3,
# top_p 0.85, repeat_penalty 1.1) and its Indonesian system prompt are
# inherited untouched — TradingAgents supplies its own system message anyway,
# and the model answers in English under it.
FROM aceptriana/alma-trader:latest
PARAMETER num_ctx 131072
PARAMETER num_batch 64
